Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.85,0:00:19.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.23,0:00:25.30,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the place...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.30,0:01:10.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, we've arrived!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.78,0:01:17.95,Episode title 5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1550,450)}Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.91,0:01:23.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.51,0:01:25.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.43,0:01:29.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sit!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.54,0:01:32.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.63,0:01:38.93,Newspaper text,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\an8\frz352.8\pos(1505,500)}Guess who\NI am
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.59,0:01:36.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, Uncle, Auntie.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.82,0:01:38.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi. Where's Grandpa?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.03,0:01:39.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the garden.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.35,0:01:40.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.80,0:01:42.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an1}Ow, you're prickly!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.15,0:01:42.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an3}I missed you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.72,Newspaper text,,0,0,0,,{\fs75\an7\frz332\pos(1260,450)}Nice to\Nsee you,\Ndear\Nfather-\Nin-law
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.00,0:01:44.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad, thanks for taking care of Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.72,0:01:56.40,Newspaper text,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\an4\frz338.8\pos(120,620)}Fine,\Ndon't\Nmind me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you dress like that when going on a trip?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.05,0:01:48.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.51,0:01:49.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.39,0:01:50.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you stay for a while?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.54,0:01:51.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.19,0:01:52.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd be too much for the animators.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.76,0:01:53.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.92,0:02:00.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.72,0:02:05.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Xiaobai's grandpa.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.95,0:02:07.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm her cousin.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.40,0:02:08.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't bite me.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.51,0:02:10.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's rather unusual.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.66,0:02:11.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei's a very friendly cat.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.96,0:02:13.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are there lots of mice in the big city?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, he doesn't catch mice.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.52,0:02:24.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So cute! What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.57,0:02:26.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a dumpling mouse, very rare.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.65,0:02:29.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So very cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.93,0:02:31.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.03,0:02:32.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.70,0:02:34.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,why do you have to keep it in a cage?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.68,0:02:36.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because dumpling mice eat everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.44,0:02:38.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anything but metal and other animals.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.69,0:02:40.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They especially like wood.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.44,0:02:41.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It could eat the whole house.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.76,0:02:43.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How? It's so small.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.05,0:02:43.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.34,0:02:47.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who thought it could eat that much?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.24,0:02:48.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We finally caught it yesterday.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.20,0:02:50.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.84,0:02:54.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it okay? They're cat and mouse after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Dumpling mice are closer to rabbits.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.61,0:03:03.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we keep it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.71,0:03:05.98,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,No, it would have to stay in the cage all the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.98,0:03:07.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure... Or it would eat the house.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.57,0:03:08.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Usually it's very meek.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.59,0:03:10.07,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Gen! Bring the eggs!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.99,0:03:09.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.07,0:03:11.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.86,0:03:13.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be nice to each other!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.55,0:03:14.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it done yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.15,0:03:14.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just be gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.87,0:03:16.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come out?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.30,0:03:25.58,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Gen! Gen!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.58,0:03:27.14,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,The dumpling mouse has escaped!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.13,0:03:26.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.14,0:03:28.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.12,0:03:29.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that hole it dug...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.36,0:03:32.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was fast...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.51,0:03:35.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's start building a new house.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.42,0:03:38.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.32,0:03:43.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a long tail!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.55,0:03:45.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But is it long enough?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.22,0:03:58.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He could catch it!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.69,0:04:05.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei is its archenemy!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.67,0:04:08.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen! Take the table outside!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.35,0:04:09.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.48,0:04:15.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you did a great job today.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.53,0:04:16.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eat up!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.40,0:04:30.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eat some more, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.07,0:04:33.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has changed color!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.67,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Dumpling mice take up the color of what they just consumed.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.67,0:04:36.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a sort of camouflage.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like magic!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.91,0:04:41.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they are being hunted for their unusual fur.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.58,0:04:43.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now only a few are left.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.36,0:04:44.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a shame.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There used to be many in the hills.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.76,0:04:46.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.59,0:04:50.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should give it a name.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.27,0:04:52.82,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be attached to it,\Nand can't let it go later.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.82,0:04:53.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.17,0:04:55.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would be a good name for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.37,0:04:57.58,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pi-yuu!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.40,0:04:59.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I name you Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.93,0:05:02.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you had a dog, you'd name it Woof-woof...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.74,0:05:14.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.24,0:05:16.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a spirit, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.27,0:05:27.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.88,0:05:30.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.26,0:05:32.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.51,0:05:33.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a spirit too.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.49,0:05:43.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why haven't they come back yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.53,0:05:55.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry for attacking you out of the blue.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.44,0:05:57.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had to make sure you're a spirit.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.35,0:06:01.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you won't hurt me either.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.82,0:06:02.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.34,0:06:06.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you be calm when I let you out?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.66,0:06:13.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You little jerk!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.08,0:06:21.42,Episode title 6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1620,515)\fad(700,0)}Gen
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.76,0:06:24.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.47,0:06:25.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.84,0:06:44.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ninja frog!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm taking revenge for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.64,0:06:47.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Turn it up!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.77,0:07:04.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take him back today.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.13,0:07:13.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why? Can't he stay here?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.58,0:07:15.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei would keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.16,0:07:17.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No good. Piyu is too dangerous at any rate.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.67,0:07:18.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He belongs to the forest.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.83,0:07:20.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's where he feels at home.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.69,0:07:21.75,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.99,0:07:22.82,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are they saying?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.64,0:07:25.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think he is fond of Xiaohei too.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.86,0:07:26.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.46,0:07:27.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it a try!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.14,0:07:30.79,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't feel good here,\Nwe can still take him to the forest.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.60,0:07:32.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.25,0:07:34.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't take your eyes off him!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.63,0:07:45.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Xiaohei, do you want to eat some fish?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.99,0:07:48.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about Mr. Piyu?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.41,0:07:49.30,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You ask me?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.98,0:07:54.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lil Ji, are you all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.65,0:07:57.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bro, Gen's got a kitty.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.42,0:08:03.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A duel of pets? Challenge accepted.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.59,0:08:04.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one challenged you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Ji's still the same, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.43,0:08:08.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He keeps trying to defeat me.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.32,0:08:09.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'd get off your back if you lost once.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.86,0:08:11.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm always trying.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.71,0:08:13.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, will you let him win now?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.40,0:08:14.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The winner is decided.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.95,0:08:21.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was fast!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.90,0:08:23.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who said they have to fight?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.35,0:08:24.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see whose one is more obedient.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.92,0:08:25.45,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Paw!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.45,0:08:26.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you listen to it?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see whose one knows better stunts.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.74,0:08:30.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our dog can swim.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.25,0:08:31.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You cat can swim?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.58,0:08:33.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That fast?! In freestyle?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.22,0:08:35.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see, whose one is better at...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.93,0:08:37.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.15,0:08:37.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ignore him...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.86,0:08:40.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's see who catches more fish today!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.49,0:08:41.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You gave up early.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.27,0:08:50.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.30,0:08:51.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will be back!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.04,0:08:58.24,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,You could catch more fish if you put your hand into the water.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.24,0:09:00.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, I would just be bitten to death...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.48,0:09:02.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go swimming.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.74,0:09:03.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.69,0:09:04.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, don't you want to be friends with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.76,0:09:11.65,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Xiaobai's cousin?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.77,0:09:12.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am him.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.15,0:09:13.94,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you. Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you still don't believe me,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can take you to a certain place.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.79,0:09:19.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to know you better too.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.55,0:09:21.89,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.07,0:09:27.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.47,0:09:28.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got big catch!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.21,0:09:33.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I go out for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.21,0:09:34.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you be back in this episode?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only at lunch.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.30,0:09:36.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.52,0:09:38.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.72,0:09:40.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei and I go for a walk.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.03,0:09:41.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Put Piyu in the cage.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.26,0:09:42.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.60,0:09:51.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gen! Going up the hills?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.44,0:09:52.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.48,0:10:00.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try not to fall behind!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.64,0:10:11.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There we are.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.85,0:10:17.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can come out!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.27,0:10:39.14,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A flower fairy...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello. Is this your new friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.70,0:10:42.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.26,0:10:45.93,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,You know I can't fake my thoughts if she transfers them to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.21,0:10:49.26,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,You can decide to tell me about yourself when you can trust me.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.26,0:10:49.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.05,0:10:54.32,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing against.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.85,0:11:21.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I name you... Yunfei!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that from?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.19,0:11:22.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sweet, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.70,0:11:23.28,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Woof!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.79,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,You sneaked into Master Lao's realm? You're so reckless!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.95,0:11:42.83,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You both are.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.77,0:11:48.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, your spirit power really is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.49,0:11:49.38,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yours too.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.58,0:11:57.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello? Shan Xin?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.27,0:12:03.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to see Piyu?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.92,0:12:06.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine, when can you come?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.27,0:12:08.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the door?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.64,0:12:09.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.43,0:12:14.27,Episode title 7,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1400,0)\pos(1570,475)}Piyu
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.58,0:12:11.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hoho, if it isn't little Sam Sung!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.38,0:12:18.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is Piyu.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.92,0:12:19.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.06,0:12:23.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi there. This is for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.44,0:12:26.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does he know what's it for?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.66,0:12:27.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.97,0:12:31.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think he likes it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.95,0:12:33.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He ate it!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I-Is this okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.53,0:12:37.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.70,0:12:38.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His color changed!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.56,0:12:39.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.05,0:12:40.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Sup, Gen.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.98,0:12:42.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, Shan Xin.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.18,0:12:45.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, Xiaohuang's come to see you!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.61,0:12:47.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A touching reunion...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.95,0:12:54.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen, you just got a whole lot funnier.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.33,0:13:02.15,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,So he can be let out\Nonly when Xiaohei's around?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.15,0:13:04.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Xiaohei is Piyu's archenemy.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.75,0:13:08.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Huang is Xiaohei's archenemy.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.29,0:13:11.09,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So even you have one...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.75,0:13:21.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eggplant!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.51,0:13:24.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is so cool...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.80,0:13:25.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.05,0:13:28.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did he eat something pee-colored before I came?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.39,0:13:30.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's his natural color.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.13,0:13:33.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How does it change back?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.38,0:13:35.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It reverts after about 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.36,0:13:38.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if he eats something patterned?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.69,0:13:39.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.39,0:13:48.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.41,0:13:50.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give him weird things to eat!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.39,0:13:51.52,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Lunch is ready!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.08,0:13:52.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.63,0:13:54.70,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.88,0:13:55.78,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Camouflage!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.10,0:13:58.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shuttlecocks?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.26,0:14:00.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is there a row of shuttlecocks?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.99,0:14:01.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.05,0:14:03.59,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep calm! Our cover is safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.99,0:14:10.00,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.82,0:14:15.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.50,0:14:17.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that funny sound?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.10,0:14:19.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here! You three eat together.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.22,0:14:34.38,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was just a nightmare...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.64,0:14:36.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happens to Piyu if he eats metal or meat?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.59,0:14:41.01,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Those are toxic to him, we must take care he doesn't eat any.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.80,0:14:42.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then {\c&d7d7d7&}panties must be safe...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.15,0:14:42.98,Main Dialogue,,0,-1000,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.98,0:14:43.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.88,0:14:46.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu! Don't eat the plate!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.21,0:14:50.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.54,0:14:52.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A box of shuttlecocks, it should be empty.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.19,0:14:55.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just packed away a few.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.30,0:15:01.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's play badminton after lunch.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.87,0:15:02.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.79,0:15:04.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't do exercise after eating.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.85,0:15:06.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll just swing the rackets a bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.65,0:15:07.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It helps digestion.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.55,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stupid racket!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.52,0:15:24.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai, give me another shuttle!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.52,0:15:27.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't we just swap?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.99,0:15:28.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serve is coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.75,0:15:29.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Badminton?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am the king of badminton!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.03,0:15:32.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Racket.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.65,0:15:37.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why can't I hit it?!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.20,0:15:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will be back!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.79,0:15:40.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is...?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.91,0:15:42.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.01,0:15:43.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We exercised enough, let's have some rest!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.96,0:15:44.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.31,0:15:48.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough playing around.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.45,0:15:50.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was this a good idea?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.62,0:15:53.87,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,One more time, and I won't let you guys out again.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.45,0:15:57.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What color he's gonna turn into?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.12,0:15:58.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must be white.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.78,0:16:04.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He didn't change!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.21,0:16:06.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you give to him?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.68,0:16:07.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A broken shuttlecock.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.91,0:16:08.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.97,0:16:09.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.49,0:16:10.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.39,0:16:12.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two go to the house!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.44,0:16:13.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I take out Piyu for a while!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.79,0:16:14.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.34,0:16:16.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.35,0:16:23.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.10,0:16:24.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're late!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.25,0:16:28.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.00,0:16:38.97,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.27,0:16:40.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His weak spot is between the eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.85,0:16:42.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would hurt him with my power.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.72,0:16:43.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.90,0:16:45.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make it quick!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.83,0:16:49.86,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let him fall!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.26,0:16:59.44,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.44,0:17:01.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A guardian spirit I left in the hills.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.14,0:17:02.47,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your spirit part? Then why...?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.47,0:17:03.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.22,0:17:04.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.59,0:17:06.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.42,0:17:07.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.24,0:17:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.08,0:17:11.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.03,0:17:12.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He will soon wake up.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.28,0:17:13.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.45,0:17:16.03,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,This is what happens if he eats metal or a living thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.03,0:17:18.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's one reason I didn't want you to keep him.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.61,0:17:20.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must take him back to the forest.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.84,0:17:21.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.19,0:17:23.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything was fine until now...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.39,0:17:25.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just have to take care...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The transformation shortens his lifespan.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it's dangerous to both of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.31,0:17:46.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's take him back...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.30,0:18:26.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohuang is clinging more and more on Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.97,0:18:28.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you'd better accept Huang.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.31,0:18:31.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you at it again? 'You two can't procreate'?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.36,0:18:34.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why should they procreate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:47.71,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:52.45,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:57.15,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:19:03.35,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:09.50,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:14.30,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:18.98,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:25.50,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:36.82,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:42.24,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:47.28,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:58.51,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:04.06,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:10.90,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
